# GitHub Clone (Node.js)

A full-stack **GitHub Clone** built with **Node.js**, providing core GitHub-like features such as authentication, repositories, commits, branches, pull requests, issues, and user profiles.

> 🚀 A learning project to understand how GitHub works under the hood using modern web technologies.

---

## 📌 Features

### 👤 Authentication
- User Registration
- Login & Logout
- JWT Authentication
- Password Hashing (bcrypt)
- Protected Routes

### 👨‍💻 User Profile
- Edit Profile
- Upload Avatar
- Bio & Social Links
- Follow / Unfollow Users

### 📁 Repository Management
- Create Repository
- Public / Private Repository
- Delete Repository
- Rename Repository
- Repository Description
- Star Repository
- Fork Repository

### 🌿 Branch Management
- Create Branch
- Delete Branch
- Switch Branch
- Merge Branch

### 📝 File Management
- Upload Files
- Create New Files
- Edit Files
- Delete Files
- Folder Structure Support
- Markdown Preview

### 💾 Commit System
- Create Commit
- Commit History
- Commit Message
- View Changes
- Restore Previous Commit



### 🐞 Issues
- Open Issue
- Close Issue
- Labels
- Assign Users
- Comments

### 💬 Comments
- Repository Comments
- Issue Comments
- Pull Request Comments

### 🔔 Notifications
- Repository Notifications
- Pull Request Notifications
- Issue Notifications

### 🔍 Search
- Search Users
- Search Repositories
- Search Issues

### ❤️ Social Features
- Follow Users
- Followers & Following
- Repository Stars
- Trending Repositories

---



