# ⚙️ Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/github-clone.git
```

```bash
cd github-clone
```

## Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

## Create Environment File

Create a `.env` file.

```env
PORT=5000

MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/github_clone

JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key

JWT_EXPIRES=7d

CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:3000

EMAIL_USER=example@gmail.com

EMAIL_PASS=password
```

---

# ▶️ Run Development Server

```bash
npm run dev
```

Server starts on

```
http://localhost:5000
```

---

# 📡 API Endpoints

## Authentication

```
POST    /api/auth/register
POST    /api/auth/login
GET     /api/auth/profile
PUT     /api/auth/profile
```

---

## Repository

```
POST    /api/repositories
GET     /api/repositories
GET     /api/repositories/:id
PUT     /api/repositories/:id
DELETE  /api/repositories/:id
```

---

## Branch

```
POST    /api/branches
GET     /api/branches/:repoId
DELETE  /api/branches/:id
```

---

## Commit

```
POST    /api/commits
GET     /api/commits/:repoId
```

---

## Pull Requests

```
POST    /api/pull-requests
GET     /api/pull-requests/:repoId
PUT     /api/pull-requests/:id
```

---

## Issues

```
POST    /api/issues
GET     /api/issues/:repoId
PUT     /api/issues/:id
DELETE  /api/issues/:id
```

---

# 🔒 Authentication

Protected routes require a JWT token.

```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
```

